{"id":"n66580-2-4","stage":0,"title":"이상 · 到此结束","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66580-2-4-1","ko":"이상으로 제 발표를 마칩니다.","zh":"以上就是我的汇报内容，到此结束。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이상으로","meaning":"以上、到此","explanation":"이상으로：正式报告结尾使用，表示“以上、到此”；-으로 在这里构成收尾表达。","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"4","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상으로","audio":"/audio/27887e91da55c508866f.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"발표를","meaning":"汇报、发言","explanation":"발표：当众报告或发表内容；-를 标记宾语。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표를","audio":"/audio/fb8eecedd8451fb146ac.mp3"}},{"text":"마칩니다.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61135","senseId":"1","lemma":"마치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마칩니다","audio":"/audio/1a871215322b92bd3800.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"到此结束","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"用于文章或讲话末尾，表示内容已讲完。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"汇报、发言","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"在众人面前说明或发表内容；本句指汇报、发言。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"48af85297dcba6b9","term":"마치다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/48af85297dcba6b93058.mp3","entryId":"61135","definition":"做的事或过程完结；或指使其完结。","pronunciation":["마치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e079fae3086b1e8a5d12.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66580-2-4-2","ko":"저기, 발표에 질문이 있는데요.","zh":"那个，我对您的汇报有个问题想问。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기,","meaning":"那个，不好意思","explanation":"저기：开口询问或引起对方注意时的委婉招呼语。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71219","senseId":"2","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"발표에","meaning":"汇报、发言","explanation":"발표：当众报告或发表内容；-에 标记所提问题涉及的对象。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발표에","audio":"/audio/c550937a2a24c60b3ab5.mp3"}},{"text":"질문이","meaning":"提问","explanation":"질문：提问；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"질문","audio":"/audio/32729cc3f7b6d44a6210.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63663","senseId":"1","lemma":"질문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질문이","audio":"/audio/3d3dba8504780ccab396.mp3"}},{"text":"있는데요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는데요","audio":"/audio/04da52440ceae8bef460.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那个，不好意思","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71219","definition":"开口说有些不便说的话时，用于引起对方注意。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"662fbb8d7bdeae80","term":"발표","zh":"汇报、发言","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3","entryId":"62470","definition":"在众人面前说明或发表内容；本句指汇报、发言。","pronunciation":["발표"]},{"id":"32729cc3f7b6d44a","te